# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI agent workspace — PRIVATE, never tracked
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# _agent_sop/ contains the agent's working notes, SOPs, decisions.
# Readers cloning this repo should NEVER see this directory.
# It exists only to coordinate the human + agent collaboration.
_agent_sop/

# AI agent session state (symlinked from ~/.omo)
.codegraph
.codegraph/
.omo/
.omo/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated artifacts — regenerated by running scripts
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
./output/

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Author scaffolding — NOT for readers; kept locally for verification only
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Tests are the author's TDD verification tool (per _agent_sop/03_STYLE.md
# §3.2 TDD 优先). Readers run code/, not tests/. Keep tests/ local-only so
# the public repo stays focused on learning content.
articles/*/tests/

